    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "taking a break isnt really an option though. whenever i try to slow down, the debt just piles up more and the people i let down get even more disappointed. there is no \"quiet step\" when everything is crashing down. it feels like the only way to actually stop the noise is to just... not be part of it anymore. does that even make sense?",
